 "nl": [
  "Hosts in edge-cache may reach vpn-users over SMTP (TCP 25).",
  "vpn-users is isolated: it may only reach scada on syslog (UDP 514), and nothing else.",
  "Any zone may connect to guest-wifi over HTTP (TCP 80).",
  "Allow voip to connect to scada using LDAP (TCP 389) and MySQL (TCP 3306).",
  "library must accept LDAP (TCP 389) and SMB (TCP 445) from edge-cache.",
  "Restrict dev-lab so that its only permitted destinations are voip on DNS over UDP 53; research on DNS over UDP 53; drop all other traffic it originates.",
  "guest-wifi must accept RDP (TCP 3389) from vpn-users.",
  "vpn-users must accept IMAP (TCP 143) and SNMP (UDP 161) from voip.",
  "Restrict edge-cache so that its only permitted destinations are library on HTTPS (TCP 443); vpn-users on HTTPS (TCP 443); drop all other traffic it originates.",
  "Allow edge-cache to connect to vpn-users using SSH (TCP 22) and LDAP (TCP 389).",
  "Make NTP (UDP 123) on vpn-users reachable from all internal zones.",
  "Allow backup to connect to edge-cache using LDAP (TCP 389).",
  "Permit TCP ports 1024-65535 from edge-cache to voip but deny RDP (TCP 3389).",
  "dev-lab must accept DNS over UDP 53 from research.",
  "Allow backup to connect to dev-lab using syslog (UDP 514).",
  "dev-lab must accept HTTPS (TCP 443) and SSH (TCP 22) and syslog (UDP 514) from library.",
  "Make DNS over UDP 53 on vpn-users reachable from all internal zones.",
  "guest-wifi may use any UDP port towards scada, except TFTP (UDP 69), which must be blocked.",
  "dev-lab offers DNS over UDP 53 and HTTPS (TCP 443) to every zone.",
  "voip must accept DNS over UDP 53 and HTTPS (TCP 443) and SMTP (TCP 25) from scada.",
  "backup must accept SSH (TCP 22) from scada.",
  "edge-cache must never reach research, regardless of any other rule.",
  "Hosts in vpn-users may reach voip over SSH (TCP 22) and HTTPS (TCP 443) and IMAP (TCP 143).",
  "Make NTP (UDP 123) on edge-cache reachable from all internal zones.",
  "Deny all traffic from edge-cache to dev-lab (this overrides any public service).",
  "library offers NTP (UDP 123) and HTTPS (TCP 443) to every zone.",
  "Allow guest-wifi to connect to dev-lab using LDAP (TCP 389) and HTTPS (TCP 443).",
  "edge-cache must accept SSH (TCP 22) and HTTPS (TCP 443) and MySQL (TCP 3306) from vpn-users.",
  "Any zone may connect to vpn-users over HTTPS (TCP 443) and DNS over UDP 53.",
  "research may use any TCP port towards dev-lab, except RDP (TCP 3389), Telnet (TCP 23), FTP (TCP 21), which must be blocked."
 ],
